      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the overview. To really nail the debate, I need to be able to present their side without it sounding like a caricature. \n\nCan you go into more detail on the \"scientific\" reasoning they use? Specifically, how do they attempt to connect evolutionary pressures in different geographic regions to specific cognitive traits? I want to understand the specific logic they use to claim these differences are innate rather than environmental. It’ll help me identify the exact gaps in their reasoning.",
